# Splunk: Data Manipulation

Splunk needs clean, well‑parsed data so logs become structured, searchable fields. When the data is organized, security teams can correlate events across systems, spot anomalies faster, and build reliable alerts. Good parsing directly improves threat detection, incident investigation, and overall system monitoring.
