## Task 2 Scenario Briefing

You’re acting as a SOC analyst at Cybertees Ltd, configuring Splunk to ingest a custom log source. Your tasks are to:

- Ensure Splunk correctly breaks incoming logs into individual events
- Handle multi‑line logs so they’re parsed as single events
- Mask sensitive data to meet PCI DSS requirements
- Extract useful fields for analysis
- The lab environment places Splunk in /opt/splunk and your scripts in /home/ubuntu/Downloads/scripts. Switch to root with sudo su, and restart Splunk with /opt/splunk/bin/splunk restart if needed.
